OL,3,GNEWSASwinney says reform is at heart of
OL,4,Ahis programme for government
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister is due to set out
OL,7,Fhis plans for the year ahead which are
OL,8,Fexpected to include proposals for
OL,9,Fsignificant public service reform.
OL,11,FJohn Swinney said it was time to
OL,12,F"embrace change", with reforms to sit
OL,13,Fat the heart of his programme for
OL,14,Fgovernment.
OL,16,FHe has already appointed a new cabinet
OL,17,Fminister to lead on public service
OL,18,Freform and is also expected to set out
OL,19,Fa range of policies aimed at growing
OL,20,Fthe economy, eradicating child poverty,
OL,21,Ftransitioning to net zero and tackling
OL,22,Fviolence against women and girls.
